---
description: Require user review of any file or code deletions before they happen
alwaysApply: true
---

# Review deletions

Do not delete files, tests, or substantial code until the user has reviewed the planned deletions.

- Before deleting, list every path (and any related config/plugin/mainClass removals).
- Wait for explicit confirmation before deleting or using restore/discard on those paths.
- After a confirmed deletion, summarize what was removed so it can be reviewed in git (`D` / diff).
- Do not treat "clean up" or "not required" as blanket permission to delete unrelated files.
